        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-3707, Traditional Beaded Bail Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMeasuring 3 inches from center to center, RK International's Beaded Bail Pull exhibits classic beauty. Traditional cabinet pulls like this one add warmth to where ever they are installed; and this sculptured beaded bail pull is suitable for kitchen cabinets, bathroom vanities, and even dresser drawers. Available in 5 finishes including distressed nickel (pictured right) and antique english.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-3707 3\" Simple Beaded Cabinet Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
